    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shikolo sha milīmo ya hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbeeja na ng'walīlo gwa shaba, gwa fuuti makūmi adatū ū būlīhu nū būgalī galī wago; ū būgūngūhu fuuti ikūmi na'itanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbeeja na nyanza",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nyanza:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ī nyanza shalī shiseme shitaale sha kūtūūlila minzī; shalī shibilingu, shitalang'hanu gīt'ikalayi itaale.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ya chūma sha kūsula; ū būgalī galī wayo ū kūfuma kū lūgala ūlū kūja ū kū lūgala ū lūngī jalī fuuti ikūmi n'itanò; ū būgūngūhu fuuti mpungatī na nusu. Ūlū lūgoye lwa kūshipīndīlīja lūkūbiza na būlīhu wa fuuti makūmi anè n'itanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha sīlīlī ya lūgala shalī shihelilwe shiikolile sha nzagamba ja ng'ombe shūpīndīlījiwa, būlī ha ng'wanya gwa nusu miita shūbiza ho shiikolile ikūmi. Ī shiikolile shenīsho shalī sha chūma shisulilwe hamò nī nyanza, hūna shūhelwa ng'hīlīlī ibīlī kūlūpīndīlīja pyī ū lūgala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nyanza yalī ījaadīkilwe ha migongo ya shiikolile sha nzagamba ja ng'ombe ikūmi n'ibīlī, idatū jūūlolela sukuma, idatū ng'weli, idatū dakama, idatū kīya. Hūna ī nyanza yūūlembeela a higūlya ya nzagamba jenījo; ī joi jiilogeja madako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būgīnu wa shiseme sha nyanza shenīsho walī gītī inchi idatū gīko; ū lūgala lwalī lūbeegije lūtaamuka gītī lwa shikombe, hūna lyūbiza gītī booba būtaale waalile. Ī nyanza yenīyo yalī na būtaale wa kūdūla kūbūūcha galani ja minzī shihūmbī ikūmi na shimò, na magana atanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbeeja na shiseme shingī ikūmi sha kūbiza gītī makalayi; ūshitūūla kūlwa koogeja, shitanò kū lwandī lwa dakama, na shitanò kū lwandī ū lwa sukuma. Ī shitambò sha kūpemvwa shoojiagwa ng'wenūmo, alīyo ī nyanza ī yene bītūmamīlaga bagabīji kūlwa kooja magūlū na makono gabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbeeja na makīndīkīlo ikūmi ga tala ga zahabu, kūlenganīla na a kabeegeje kajo ako kaalī kahayiwe; hūna ūjitūūla mu hekalu, itanò jūbiza kū lwandī lwa dakama itanò lwandī lwa sukuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ūbeeja na meza ikūmi ūjitūūla ū mu hekalu; itanò kū lwandī lwa dakama, itanò lwa sukuma. Ūbeeja na mabbakuli igana ga zahabu ga kūseseebelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī gwaalugwa ya bagabīji wībeeja, nī libīndo ī litaale, nī milyango ya h'ibīndo. Ī milyango wīnaagīla shaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nyanza wītūūla kū lwandī lwa dakama ya kīya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbeeja na nzweso, hamò na makolelo na mabakuli ga kūseseebelela. Na lūūlū ū Hulamu ūmala pyī ī milīmo ya ntemi Solomoni īyo wībeejaga mu hekalu ya ng'wa Mulungu; ī milīmo ya kūbeeja shikolo gītī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'hīngī īj'ibīlī, na a makundīkījo ayo abīlī a ga kūbiza gītī mabbakuli, ayo akajizwīka ī ng'hīngī jenījo būbīlī wajo; nū tūlweyo ūto akatūdaamīlīja a ha makundīkījo ga ng'hīngī genayo kūlwa būlenji; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na a makomamanga a magana anè ayo akagatūūla a higūlya ya makundīkījo genayo būbīlī wago, (ng'hīlīlī ibīlī ja makomamanga ījo jikatūūlwa a higūlya ya tūlweyo kūlwa kūtūūla būlenji a ha makundīkījo a ga kūbiza gītī mabbakuli, ayo gaalī a ha ng'hīngī jenījo); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na a makīndīkīlo ayo ikūmi nī shiseme īsho ikūmi ī sha kūtūūla a makīndīkīlo genayo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nī nyanza, nī nzagamba īj'ikūmi n'ibīlī ījo jalī ha sīlīlī yayo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nī nzweso, na a makolelo, na a mabbakuli ga kūseseebelela. Ī shikolo shose shenīshi īsho Hulamu-abi akameegeja ntemi Solomoni kūlwa nguno ya hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, shalī sha shaba īguusilwe yūlabangīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi walī walagīja yaabiwa ī shaba mu maabījo ga malongo, kū mbūga ya kū mongo gwa Yolodani; sī ya mīmbī na Sukoti na Zalesani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikolo īsho Solomoni akabeeja shenīshi shikakwīla no, ūleka nū kūbūlola ū būdito wa shaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Solomoni ūbiza washibeeja pyī ī shikolo īsho shalī mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA; shikolo gītī, Ng'walīlo gwa zahabu, meza ījo jatūmamīlagwa kūtūūlwa migatī ya shiizūkījo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "makīndīkīlo ga tala ayo gaalī ga zahabu yawiza nī tala jago, kūlwa kūbaka ū kū būtongi w'ipandī ī lyeela no no no, gīt'ūmo gwalī gūhelelilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī shikolo ī shingī ī sha zahabu; gītī, būlenji wa bonji, tala, na a masabūlīlo ga shikolo shisebu (a gene gaalī gabeejiwe ga zahabu yoi yenekīlī dūhū); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "majimījo ga tala ga zahabu yawiza, mabbakūli ga kūseseebelela, shijiko, shiseme sha kūtūmamīla kūzuukīja būbbani, milyango ya zahabu ya kwingīlīla mu hekalu; nī milyango ya mu gatī ī ya kwingīlīla ng'wipandī lyeela no no no; nī milyango ya ha nyango ū gwa kwingīla mu chumba shitaale ī sha mu hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
